---
// /lab/motion — the Motion Lab's address. Not a page of its own: it opens the
// site's home with the lab panel open (?lab=1), which keeps it open for the
// tab across navigations until ?lab=0 or the panel's × button. The lab lives
// in src/scripts/motion-lab.js; the defaults it tunes in src/data/motion.json.
// noindex: this is a tool, not part of the portfolio (yet).
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/?lab=1">
  <title>Motion Lab — Takao Umehara</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://takaoumehara.com/">
  <script is:inline>location.replace("/?lab=1");</script>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Outfit', 'Noto Sans JP', 'Hiragino Sans', 'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN', 'Yu Gothic', system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 16px;">
  <p><a href="/?lab=1">Open the Motion Lab →</a></p>
</body>
</html>
